{"version":1,"key":"quest:49","content":{"id":49,"title":"package.json 里面的 resolution 是做什么用的？","summary":"暂未记录答案","target":{"key":"quest:49","type":"quest","id":49},"groupId":2,"groupTitle":"前端","groupColor":"mint-green","status":"resolved","answers":[],"materials":[{"index":1,"kind":"card","group":"note","title":"resolutions 字段强制指定依赖版本","meta":"","excerpt":"package.json 中的 resolutions 字段是 yarn 和 pnpm 包管理器提供的一个功能，用来强制指定依赖项的版本（包括嵌套依赖），减少依赖冲突问题。 常见应用场景： 覆盖依赖版本，比如 A 依赖 C@1.0.0，B 依赖 C@2.0.0，两个版本间存在冲突，可以通过 resolutions 指定","target":{"key":"card:581","type":"card","id":581},"citeKey":"card:581"}],"trail":[{"time":1745232763063,"tone":"start","text":"提出问题","refs":[]},{"time":1745318509469,"tone":"milestone","text":"写下卡片","refs":[1]},{"time":1745318509469,"tone":"done","text":"标为已解决","refs":[]}],"createTime":1745232763063,"updateTime":1745232763063,"resolvedTime":1745318509469},"meta":{"type":"quest","publishTime":1745232763063}}